    <string name="disclosure_title">SMS access for money management</string>
    <string name="disclosure_body">SpendSMS needs read-only access to SMS so it can analyse transactional alerts for the period you select.\n\n• Purpose: budget and spending overview from financial SMS\n• Access: read SMS only — never send, delete, or modify messages\n• Storage: extracted transactions stay on this device\n• Sharing: raw SMS never leaves the device\n• Deletion: remove analysed data from Settings → Data and privacy</string>
